      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "From what I understand, disabling that option breaks other functionality-- hence why we haven't changed it.\n\nThese things tend to be more complicated than a checkbox!\n\nWe are looking into it though. For now, if your arms are pulling you, that's an indicator that your rig's arms are a bit too short.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
